flight.md", "source_location": "\u00a72 D9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The residual difference between preview and production is Apple paperwork, not code, so internal distribution carries S1\u2013S6.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s0_scaffold_testflight_react_version", "label": "Workspace React pinned to 19.2.3", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s0-scaffold-testflight.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "react-native@0.86 has the tighter peer constraint (^19.2.3) while Next only asks ^19.0.0, so the workspace takes RN's number; exact pin avoids two sources of truth.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s0_scaffold_testflight_metro_resolution", "label": "Metro resolving @tutor/shared subpath exports", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s0-scaffold-testflight.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Raw TS via subpath exports under hoisted pnpm must resolve; metro.config.js is not created in SDK 57.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s0_scaffold_testflight_eas_json", "label": "eas.json build profiles", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s0-scaffold-testflight.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "node must be an exact version; env.APP_VARIANT per profile because .env never reaches cloud builds.", "_origin": "semantic"}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s0_scaffold_testflight_d9_testflight_deferred", "target": "docs_2026_08_12_expo_build_plan_release_tail", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s0-scaffold-